    mp_take:'<b>Why an analyst needs this:</b> these are not puzzles for their own sake. A hash map is how a JOIN works; a sliding window is a rolling metric; prefix sums are cumulative totals; intervals are session and subscription overlaps. You meet these patterns in data every week — the interview just strips them down.',
