    home_brand:'Data for Everyone',
    home_tagline:'Free, browser-based tools and guides for making confident decisions from data — no signup, nothing leaves your device.',
    home_pick:'What do you want to work on?',
    home_pick_sub:'Four connected toolkits. Plan and analyse an experiment, measure impact when a clean test is impossible, or sharpen the Python and SQL you use every day.',
    home_ab_title:'A/B Testing Calculator',
    home_ab_desc:'Plan a test, analyse your results, and learn the theory. Picks the right statistical test for your metric, sizes the sample, and gives a plain-English verdict.',
