    home_causal_title:'Causal Inference',
    home_causal_desc:"How to measure a real effect when you can't run a clean A/B test. Five practical methods, when to use each, their limits, and runnable Python.",
    home_causal_1:'Difference-in-Differences, RDD, IV, matching, synthetic control',
