    rev_step:'Reverse mode', rev_title:'🔄 What lift can I detect?',
    rev_hint:'The opposite question: given the traffic and time you actually have, this finds the smallest relative lift the test could reliably detect — using the same baseline, α, power and variants set above.',
    rev_daily:'Daily eligible users', rev_daily_tip:'total across all variants',
